  "description": "The anonymizer shell: the AnonymizerScreen a host app mounts — one local file picker, best-effort identification of the picked file against the closed format registry (PDF and HAR), and the routed format panel. Client-side end to end: identify, decode, review, blob download. An optional serverSource render-slot lets a host offer server-held archives without this package speaking to any server. Issues no writes.",
